"entity": {
"name": "Paragon Banking Group PLC",
"description": "Paragon Banking Group Plc engages in the provision of finance. It also provides mortgages, finance, and vehicle contracts. The company operates through the Mortgage Lending and Commercial Lending segments. The Mortgage Lending segment includes the firm's buy-to-let, and owner-occupied first and second charge lending and related activities. The Commercial Lending segment involves equipment leasing, development finance, structured lending, and other offerings targeted towards SMEs. The company was founded in 1985 and is headquartered in Solihull, the United Kingdom.",
